        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "쭉쭉 늘어나는 혓바닥으로 무엇이든\n휘감는다. 함부로 다가가면\n타액으로 끈적끈적거리게 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il enroule tout dans sa langue extensible. Ceux qui\nl’approchent finissent couverts de bave.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es umklammert Dinge mit seiner dehnbaren Zunge.\nKommt man ihm zu nahe, wird man eingespeichelt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Agarra cosas con su lengua extensible. Si te acercas\nmucho, te deja lleno de babas.",
